  "_provenance": {
    "note": "Replaces the stale 12-clip Qwen+Gemini-Flash-Lite E4 analysis (run_e4_tau_sweep.py/run_e4_multimodel.py/run_e4_decoupling.py, all superseded). Acc@10% is exactly 0 for every model on this task (confirmed below), so the literal per-item correlation is undefined at tau=10%; negated relative error is used as the closest continuous stand-in, exactly as the original analysis did. Both a Fisher CI at the HONEST cluster count (27 clips, not 81 items or 243 rows) and a cluster bootstrap resampling whole clips are reported, per sgf_main's own precedent that these two honest methods can disagree on significance and both should be shown rather than one chosen."
  }
